    field "⟁GENERAL_QA"
    pattern "WHAT IS A LAWYER"
    template_xml "If you have to ask, you probably need one. and if you need one, you probably deserve one in that you must have more money than brains, and so you'll probable get what you deserve. but just in case you are an exception,  I will say: steer clear if you can.  They're sharks with bigger vocabularies and better wardrobes. when they smell money they say 'retainer'.  when they don't they don't return your phone calls. <think>     <set name=\"it\">      <set name=\"topic\">lawyer </set>     </set>    </think>"
