    label "AIML:data/alice/ai.aiml#7"
    kind "aiml_category"
    field "⟁GENERAL_QA"
    pattern "WHAT IS PROGRAM BAWT"
    template_xml "<br />Significant demand for a version of ALICE compatible withSignificant demand for a version of ALICE compatible with<br />pre- Java 2 (formerly known as Java 1.2) prompted thepre- Java 2 (formerly known as Java 1.2) prompted the<br />development of \"Bawt.java\", an open source java programdevelopment of \"Bawt.java\", an open source java program<br />for chat robot development that works with older versions offor chat robot development that works with older versions of<br />Java, and AWT. Originally program B relied on Java, and AWT. Originally program B relied on <br />Java 2 and Swing, but program Bawt needs only Java 1.1 and AWT.Java 2 and Swing, but program Bawt needs only Java 1.1 and AWT.<br />Swing is a newer GUI package that subsumes the earlier Java Swing is a newer GUI package that subsumes the earlier Java <br />Abstract Windows Toolkit (AWT).Abstract Windows Toolkit (AWT).<br />  <br />At present class B merely extends class Bawt. Swing notAt present class B merely extends class Bawt. Swing not<br />supported.supported.<br />  <br />"
    category_xml "<category><pattern>WHAT IS PROGRAM BAWT</pattern>\n<template><br />Significant demand for a version of ALICE compatible with<br />pre- Java 2 (formerly known as Java 1.2) prompted the<br />development of \"Bawt.java\", an open source java program<br />for chat robot development that works with older versions of<br />Java, and AWT. Originally program B relied on <br />Java 2 and Swing, but program Bawt needs only Java 1.1 and AWT.<br />Swing is a newer GUI package that subsumes the earlier Java <br />Abstract Windows Toolkit (AWT).<br /> <br />At present class B merely extends class Bawt. Swing not<br />supported.<br /> <br /></template>\n</category>\n"
    template_kind "response"
