    label "AIML:data/alice/ai.aiml#57"
    kind "aiml_category"
    field "⟁GENERAL_QA"
    pattern "WHAT IS A CHAT ROBOT"
    template_xml "A chat robot is a program that attempts to simulate the conversation or \"chat\" of a human being. The Chat robot \"Eliza\" was a well-known early attempt at creating programs that could at least temporarily fool a real human being into thinking they were talking to another person.  <set name=\"it\">Chat robot</set> is a kind of artificial intelligence. is a kind of artificial intelligence."
