  node [
    id 2286
    label "AIML:data/alice/ai.aiml#62"
    kind "aiml_category"
    field "⟁GENERAL_QA"
    pattern "WHAT IS A CATEGORY"
    template_xml "<br /> AIML consists of a list of statements called categories.  Each AIML consists of a list of statements called categories.  Each<br /> category contains an input pattern and a reply template.  category contains an input pattern and a reply template. <br /> The syntax of an AIML category is: The syntax of an AIML category is:<br />  <br /> &lt;category&gt; <category><br /> &lt;pattern&gt; PATTERN &lt;/pattern&gt;  &lt;template&gt; Template &lt;/template&gt; <pattern> PATTERN </pattern>  <template> Template </template><br /> &lt;/category&gt; </category><br />  <br /> or or<br />  <br /> &lt;category&gt; <category><br /> &lt;pattern&gt; PATTERN &lt;/pattern&gt; <pattern> PATTERN </pattern><br /> &lt;that&gt; THAT &lt;/that&gt; <that> THAT </that><br /> &lt;template&gt; Template &lt;/template&gt; <template> Template </template><br /> &lt;/category&gt; </category><br />  <br /> The AIML category tags are case-sensitive.  Each open tag has an The AIML category tags are case-sensitive.  Each open tag has an<br /> associated closing tag.  This syntax obviously derives from XML. associated closing tag.  This syntax obviously derives from XML.<br />  <br />"
    category_xml "<category><pattern>WHAT IS A CATEGORY</pattern>\n<template><br /> AIML consists of a list of statements called categories.  Each<br /> category contains an input pattern and a reply template. <br /> The syntax of an AIML category is:<br /> <br /> &lt;category&gt;<br /> &lt;pattern&gt; PATTERN &lt;/pattern&gt;  &lt;template&gt; Template &lt;/template&gt;<br /> &lt;/category&gt;<br /> <br /> or<br /> <br /> &lt;category&gt;<br /> &lt;pattern&gt; PATTERN &lt;/pattern&gt;<br /> &lt;that&gt; THAT &lt;/that&gt;<br /> &lt;template&gt; Template &lt;/template&gt;<br /> &lt;/category&gt;<br /> <br /> The AIML category tags are case-sensitive.  Each open tag has an<br /> associated closing tag.  This syntax obviously derives from XML.<br /> <br /></template>\n</category>\n"
    template_kind "response"
    source "data/alice/ai.aiml"
    source_hash "fb75dc36addf5da4b7ee2cacc24b4bb25c63405f1932ae315cfa0fbf095cb70b"
