  node [
    id 2338
    label "AIML:data/alice/ai.aiml#114"
    kind "aiml_category"
    field "⟁GENERAL_QA"
    pattern "IS AI ABOUT *"
    template_xml "Sometimes but not always or even usually. On the one hand, we can learn  something about how to make machines solve problems by observing other  people or just by observing our own methods. On the other hand, most work in  AI involves studying the problems the world presents to intelligence rather  than studying people or animals. AI researchers are free to use methods that  are not observed in people or that involve much more computing than people  can do.  <think><set name=\"it\"><set name=\"topic\">ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE</set></set></think>"
    category_xml "<category><pattern>IS AI ABOUT *</pattern>\n<template>Sometimes but not always or even usually. On the one hand, we can learn  something about how to make machines solve problems by observing other  people or just by observing our own methods. On the other hand, most work in  AI involves studying the problems the world presents to intelligence rather  than studying people or animals. AI researchers are free to use methods that  are not observed in people or that involve much more computing than people  can do.  <think><set name=\"it\"><set name=\"topic\">ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE</set></set></think></template>\n</category>\n"
