    template_xml "sandbox_duel.py runs two bots on the same word problem:\n  Bot A — KHANARY.exe uses AIML patterns, SRILM n-gram scoring, and the K'UHUL phase engine.\n  Bot B — NeuralGrammar uses Qwen3-1.7B with VerbEngine operation selection.\nBoth share the word-problem driver (drivers/micronauts/semantic/word-problem.json).\nRun: py -3 tools\\sandbox_duel.py \"your word problem here\""
