    pattern "WHAT IS THE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN DIRECTED AND UNDIRECTED GRAPHS"
    template_xml "In a directed graph, each edge has an orientation: it goes from a source vertex to a target vertex. In an undirected graph, edges are symmetric — if A connects to B then B connects to A."
