    kind "aiml_category"
    field "⟁KNOWLEDGE"
    pattern "IS SPECTRAL CLUSTERING A RELIABLE METHOD FOR COMMUNITY DETECTION"
    template_xml "Yes, under well-separated cluster assumptions. Spectral clustering uses the eigenvectors of the graph Laplacian to project vertices into a low-dimensional space before k-means clustering. It is robust to non-convex cluster shapes but sensitive to the choice of k."
