    label "AIML:data/alice/graph-fold-field.aiml#46"
    kind "aiml_category"
    field "⟁KNOWLEDGE"
    pattern "DOES THE FOLD GRAPH PRESERVE ORIENTATION UNDER SYMMETRIC FOLD"
    template_xml "Yes for symmetric folds: if fold f maps phase A to phase B with weight w, the reverse is recorded as a separate fold entry from B to A. The orientation is explicit in the from_phase/to_phase fields, so symmetry is a design choice, not a structural guarantee."
    category_xml "<category>\n    <pattern>DOES THE FOLD GRAPH PRESERVE ORIENTATION UNDER SYMMETRIC FOLD</pattern>\n    <template>Yes for symmetric folds: if fold f maps phase A to phase B with weight w, the reverse is recorded as a separate fold entry from B to A. The orientation is explicit in the from_phase/to_phase fields, so symmetry is a design choice, not a structural guarantee.</template>\n  </category>\n\n  \n  "
